  "version": "0.1.0",
  "author": "idv7lol contributors",
  "description": "A cyberpunk heads-up: huge neon speed inside holo rings that turn both ways, a segmented rev bar with a sync strip that flashes at the limit, the gear in a diamond, a system readout of oil, coolant, boost and air on the left, a fuel cell and range, the time and odometer on the right. The speed glitches past 130, OVERDRIVE flashes near the redline and STANDBY breathes at a stop.",
